raw/fi_clay/Database_FI_CLAY_14_856_version2.xlsx is the unchanged FI-CLAY
database, version 2, by Monica Susanne Löfman and Leena Korkiala-Tanttu,
published under CC BY 4.0 at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5040083.
The FI-CLAY rows in processed/ are a selection of its records with two
derived columns: rho = unit weight / 9.80665 and alpha = Cc / (1 + e0).
